<title>VENEZUELA: Venepal yr net rises.</title>
<headline>Venepal yr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net 12.036 billion bolivars vs 5.159 billion</p>
<p>Revenues 91.349 billion bolivars vs 102.504 billion</p>
<p>Notes: Period ending October 31 1996.</p>
<p>Results are inflation-adjusted.</p>
<p>Venepal is a paper and pulp manufacturer.</p>
<p>US company Stone Container Corp and Onofre Group Ltd hold 34 percent of Venepal's paid-up capital.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
